，才缓缓开口：“这是慕辰国，小姐是沐府的二小姐，名唤，沐青颜，沐府是整个慕辰国最富有的财主……”蓝雅闭着眼睛听着耳边沉香的话语，也算是字面之上的了解，沐家老爷沐之航，有一妻一妾，各自生有一女，而沐青颜便是妾室所生，虽然不受宠爱，但也衣食无忧。沐青颜和二夫人感情很好，二夫人虽不得宠，对于这个女人可疼到了骨子里，别说是一剑，就散是要了她的命，她都愿意。沐之航没有儿子，所以很多希望都放在女儿的身上，沐家大小姐，聪慧过人，二小姐，虽长着一副好皮囊，但野蛮无比，性情更是恶劣，自小便与北周三王爷定下婚约，北周三王爷幼年时便被送到慕辰作为质子，没有好的前途。所以沐之航期望更多便是沐家大小姐能嫁个皇亲贵族，光宗耀祖。转眼三日过去。对于这个时代，蓝雅也大致了解，三天了，除了沉香她不曾见到过府中的任何人，心下也明白，当日她蒙上了如此大的丑闻，谁还敢和她亲近。如此便正好合了她的心意，省的还要应付那些个琐碎之事，如今阳光正盛，蓝雅坐在房间，捧着历史书看的津津有味。昨日她知道狂王是何等人物之时，稍稍震惊了一番，没想到一来就得罪了那一座大佛，心中有些懊恼没有早点看清状况。如今后悔已完了，如今也只能祈求他不会找自己的麻烦，若不然她当真应付不来。在这个时代，讲究的是武力，而她偏偏没有学过武术，从小被选中当做药物的棋子，他们时时刻刻都在提防，更别说让她学习武术了。身在银月家族虽然是药物棋子，虽然暗地里处处提放，看管严实除外，银月家族的人对她也算恭敬，只要她想要的，他们便会送进来，碟片，歌曲，电影，书籍这些从来不缺。蓝雅合上书籍，想着现代的种种，暗淡一笑，如今，在这个时代若没有如今这样一个身份，像她这样一个废了双腿的人，还真不好生存，除了一身药血和医术，她会的不多。她的双腿筋脉不断了个彻底，这样的手法，筋脉断到如此，换做别人死都接不回去，显然那个男人也算准了，将她腿上的筋脉毁个彻底。她自身抵抗力强，浑身都是药，筋脉血液由于从小被药物磨练，比一般人要强上很多，想要接回去还是有希望的。新文新气象，本文有宠有虐，还有聪明宝宝，女主一步一步变强，爱情感人至深。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/shenyiqifei/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Miss Mu, \"How is the Second Madam now?\" If she hadn't looked like her daughter, she might not have come to the rescue. Lanya laughed at herself, even if she was a substitute, she would remember Yi Jian's kindness in her heart. \"The wound is not very deep. The doctor said that we need to rest for two months. Don't worry, young lady, the second lady's body and bones are better than the average person.\" Chenxiang didn't want the young lady to worry too much, so he calmed her down in a few words to reassure her. Lanya knew that the injury was not ordinary. Seeing that Chenxiang didn't want to say more, she stopped asking. \"Tell me about this country and who I am.\" Facing a strange dynasty and a new identity, it was necessary for her to understand everything here. Chen Xiang thought for a moment before speaking slowly: \"This is the Mu Chen Kingdom. The young lady is the second lady of the Mu Mansion. Her name is Mu Qingyan. The Mu Mansion is the richest man in the entire Muchen Kingdom...\" Lan Ya closed her eyes and listened to Chen Xiang's words in her ears. She understood it literally. Mu Zhihang, the master of the Mu family, had a wife and a concubine, each of whom gave birth to a daughter. Mu Qingyan was born from a concubine. Although she was not favored, she had no worries about food and clothing. Mu Qingyan and the Second Madam have a very good relationship. Although the Second Madam is not favored, she loves this woman to the core. She is willing to kill her with just one sword, let alone a sword. Mu Zhihang has no sons, so he places a lot of hopes on his daughters. The eldest daughter of the Mu family is extremely intelligent, and the second daughter, although she has a good skin, is extremely savage and has an even worse temperament. She has been engaged to Prince Bei Zhou since she was a child. Prince Bei Zhou was sent to Mu Chen as a hostage when he was young and has no good future. Therefore, Mu Zhihang hopes more that the eldest daughter of the Mu family can marry a royal family member and honor her ancestors. Three days passed in the blink of an eye. Lan Ya also had a general understanding of this era. In the past three days, she had not seen anyone in the house except Chenxiang. She also understood in her heart that no one would dare to get close to her after she was covered in such a big scandal that day. This suited her perfectly and saved her from having to deal with those trivial matters. Now that the sun was shining, Lanya was sitting in the room, holding a history book and reading it with gusto. Yesterday, when she found out who the Mad King was, she was slightly shocked. She didn't expect to offend that giant Buddha as soon as she arrived, and she felt a little annoyed that she didn't see the situation clearly earlier. Now that she has finished regretting it, she can only pray that he won't cause trouble for her, otherwise she really won't be able to cope with it. In this era, what matters is force, but she has never learned martial arts. She has been selected as a pawn for medicine since she was a child. They are always on guard against her, let alone letting her learn martial arts. Although she is a drug pawn in the Silver Moon family, although she is secretly promoted everywhere, except for strict supervision, the people of the Silver Moon family are also respectful to her. As long as she wants, they will send her in. There is never a shortage of CDs, songs, movies, and books. Lan Ya closed the book, thinking about modern times, and smiled darkly. Now, in this era, if she didn't have such an identity, it would be difficult for a person like her with a broken leg to survive. Apart from a body of medicine and medical skills, she didn't know much. The veins and veins in her legs were completely severed. With such a technique, the veins and veins in her legs were severed to such an extent that no one else would be able to reattach them. Obviously, that man was also accurate and completely destroyed the veins in her legs. Her own resistance is strong and her whole body is covered with medicine. Her muscles and blood are much stronger than ordinary people because she has been trained by medicine since she was a child. There is still hope for her to be able to be taken back. New text, new atmosphere, this text is both pampering and abusive, and there is also a smart baby. The heroine becomes stronger step by step, and the love is deeply touching.", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}